 "shownotes": [
  "Bustout city: Glide (first since 8/31/21), Cold as Ice (first since 5/18/92 — 1,468 shows), and The Vibration of Life narration (first since 11/19/96) woven into David Bowie. Axilla played '92-style with no Part II outro; Mike's Song brought the trampolines back.",
  "Community pulse — called an instant classic, \"all-killer, no-filler.\" Fish's vacuum turn in Love You and the Bouncing Around the Room jam drew special mention."
 ],
